 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "root is an N-ary tree in LeetCode level-order form: the root value, then for each node in breadth-first order the values of its children followed by null as a group separator, with trailing nulls removed ([] is the empty tree). Each day every current leaf is removed. Return the list of days, where entry i lists the values removed on day i + 1. Because the order within a day is free, each day is returned sorted ascending. Return [] for the empty tree.",
